dsh-image-tiler README · Desktop profile, by hand：Add the dependency and the bundle to `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`, then install and
restart the app from the tray:

```json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-image-tiler": "0.1.7" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["...", "dsh-image-tiler"] } }
}

dsh-image-tiler README · 桌面版（desktop profile）手动安装：把依赖与 bundle 加进 `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`，装好后从托盘彻底退出再重启：

```json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-image-tiler": "0.1.7" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["...", "dsh-image-tiler"] } }
}
